     "metadata": "",
     "title": "Community Pool Spend - Retire 925,000 ZIG (Cycle 3, September 2026)",
     "summary": "> **TL;DR**: This proposal permanently retires **925,000 $ZIG** from circulation, funded by ZIG Markets revenue from September 2026. **YES** = retire. **NO** = funds stay in the Community Pool.\n\n \n\n## **1) Summary**\n\n \n\nThis proposal requests a Community Pool spend to retire **925,000 $ZIG** from the **Community Pool** to the **Retirement Wallet**, as part of the September 2026 $ZIG tokenomics cycle. Retired $ZIG is permanently removed from active ecosystem circulation. Full execution details below.\n\n---\n\n \n\n## **2) Background**\n\n \n\nThe $ZIG tokenomics establishes a recurring monthly cycle:\n\n- $ZIG is market-acquired and settled into the onchain **Community Pool**.\n- A portion of the acquired $ZIG is designated for Retirement (permanent removal from active ecosystem circulation), subject to validator governance approval. The remainder is designated for the Ecosystem Pool.\n\nThis proposal covers the Retirement portion for the September 2026 cycle.\n\n---\n\n \n\n## **3) Proposed Action**\n\n \n\nIf this proposal passes, a ***MsgCommunityPoolSpend*** will transfer:\n\n**Amount:** **925,000 $ZIG** (**925000000000** uzig)\n**From:** **Community Pool** (***zig1jv65s3grqf6v6jl3dp4t6c9t9rk99cd8x4pwth***)\n**To:** **Retirement Wallet** (***zig14har2kjzze5adwprvwjtruf2lzvfta53wflpml***)\n\nExecution is automatic upon passing, at the end of the voting period (block level). No individual signs or triggers the transfer manually.\n\n---\n\n \n\n## **4) Rationale**\n\n \n\n- Retirement permanently removes the specified $ZIG from active ecosystem circulation, supporting the value-accrual mechanism described in the $ZIG tokenomics.\n- Routing the action through the **Community Pool** and onchain governance keeps it transparent, validator-approved, and independently verifiable — no privileged manual transfer.\n\n---\n\n \n\n## **5) Transparency & Verification**\n\n \n\n- **Classification by destination:** Retirement is determined by destination address, not by label. Any Community Pool spend to the **Retirement Wallet** counts as a Retirement regardless of how the proposal is titled.\n- After execution, anyone can independently verify that the **Retirement Wallet** balance increased by **925,000 $ZIG** and view the onchain transfer.\n\n---\n\n \n\n## **6) Voting**\n\n \n\nEligible voters: ZIGChain validators (stake-weighted). This proposal follows the standard governance path — deposit period, discussion, and a 96-hour voting window — with no expedited process used.\n\n**YES** — Approve the Retirement of **925,000 $ZIG** from the **Community Pool** for the September 2026 cycle.\n**NO** — Reject. The funds remain in the **Community Pool** (designated to the Ecosystem Pool).\n**NO WITH VETO** — Strong objection to the proposal.\n**ABSTAIN** — No explicit position; contributes to quorum.\n\n---\n\n \n\n## **7) References**\n\n \n\n[$ZIG Tokenomics paper](https://whitepaper.zigchain.com/zig-tokenomics.pdf)\n**Community Pool Wallet:** ***zig1jv65s3grqf6v6jl3dp4t6c9t9rk99cd8x4pwth***\n**Retirement Wallet:** ***zig14har2kjzze5adwprvwjtruf2lzvfta53wflpml***",
     "proposer": "zig13tr0axv0h8z2jgzsfw3ee0w25lpwturl2mak88",
     "expedited": false,
     "failed_reason": "proposal did not get enough votes to pass"
    }
